broadcast\nover websocket, following the chat example's ingest-thread/watch-channel\narchitecture. Includes instant elimination (debounced sweep detection),\n3-hour timeout with percentage/headcount tiebreak, and a curated NYC\nparks battleground catalog (NYC Open Data, since Foursquare's dataset is\nnow gated).\n\nAlso derives Serialize/Deserialize for fold::pipeline::Keyed, needed for\nRetain to wrap a KeyedStream's root Keyed<K, V> type directly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9940532391ac52ae80df3369c5efcf658425b538","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/git/trees/9940532391ac52ae80df3369c5efcf658425b538"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/git/commits/f8b6a78d0a75bc902f9bb4ecc5c25470fffea315","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAge67vLMJpFKoylT1GXAp6jFhklz\nSETagmDKa9bm63+OoAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQNIcAYhRArFUozboLwC+khhyB/MSvNuyjskPj+Yd1L+tXQlExjmOt7ZvdtRvWtqe1/\ngJ6uQ5nC8tGOaEk6ZAnQw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 9940532391ac52ae80df3369c5efcf658425b538\nparent 4f032ebad481d2a3c54b7c6dfe5ce222fc288b84\nauthor rcrdlbl <bluh@outlook.com> 1783883975 -0400\ncommitter rcrdlbl <bluh@outlook.com> 1783883975 -0400\n\nimplement area denial location-based game (mmo-cs)\n\nLive location-based team game built on fold: a roster pipeline and a\nRetain-bounded presence pipeline drive a two-team scoreboard broadcast\nover websocket, following the chat example's ingest-thread/watch-channel\narchitecture. Includes instant elimination (debounced sweep detection),\n3-hour timeout with percentage/headcount tiebreak, and a curated NYC\nparks battleground catalog (NYC Open Data, since Foursquare's dataset is\nnow gated).\n\nAlso derives Serialize/Deserialize for fold::pipeline::Keyed, needed for\nRetain to wrap a KeyedStream's root Keyed<K, V> type directly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","verified_at":"2026-07-12T19:19:43Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/commits/f8b6a78d0a75bc902f9bb4ecc5c25470fffea315","html_url":"https://github.com/flowercomputers/bogkit/commit/f8b6a78d0a75bc902f9bb4ecc5c25470fffea315","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/commits/f8b6a78d0a75bc902f9bb4ecc5c25470fffea315/comments","author":{"login":"rcrdlbl","id":40729534,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzI5NTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40729534?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl","html_url":"https://github.com/rcrdlbl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"rcrdlbl","id":40729534,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzI5NTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40729534?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl","html_url":"https://github.com/rcrdlbl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"4f032ebad481d2a3c54b7c6dfe5ce222fc288b84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/commits/4f032ebad481d2a3c54b7c6dfe5ce222fc288b84","html_url":"https://github.com/flowercomputers/bogkit/commit/4f032ebad481d2a3c54b7c6dfe5ce222fc288b84"}]},{"sha":"8a4ef607df37ecfab5c5d0bebfe2e3e252b6021e","node_id":"C_kwDOTWXhVNoAKDhhNGVmNjA3ZGYzN2VjZmFiNWM1ZDBiZWJmZTJlM2UyNTJiNjAyMWU","commit":{"author":{"name":"rcrdlbl","email":"bluh@outlook.com","date":"2026-07-12T19:30:45Z"},"committer":{"name":"rcrdlbl","email":"bluh@outlook.com","date":"2026-07-12T19:30:45Z"},"message":"mmo-cs: show the player's own in/out-of-bounds status\n\nComputed entirely client-side from the last geolocation fix against the\nbattle's bbox (already broadcast in every scoreboard), so it updates\nimmediately on each GPS fix rather than waiting on the ping-send throttle\nor a server round-trip.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"66871fd18e5e610f10350d79742d59f08befca45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/git/trees/66871fd18e5e610f10350d79742d59f08befca45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/git/commits/8a4ef607df37ecfab5c5d0bebfe2e3e252b6021e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAge67vLMJpFKoylT1GXAp6jFhklz\nSETagmDKa9bm63+OoAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQOYRlE6waQgf+BK7XUEBfNiT3tYTLUzph4EwQNdZcGqJyKpLfFMzbX4iyvccQezzjT\nmTg8Sm86wrAOMklHZ8YAw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 66871fd18e5e610f10350d79742d59f08befca45\nparent f8b6a78d0a75bc902f9bb4ecc5c25470fffea315\nauthor rcrdlbl <bluh@outlook.com> 1783884645 -0400\ncommitter rcrdlbl <bluh@outlook.com> 1783884645 -0400\n\nmmo-cs: show the player's own in/out-of-bounds status\n\nComputed entirely client-side from the last geolocation fix against the\nbattle's bbox (already broadcast in every scoreboard), so it updates\nimmediately on each GPS fix rather than waiting on the ping-send throttle\nor a server round-trip.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","verified_at":"2026-07-12T19:30:52Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/commits/8a4ef607df37ecfab5c5d0bebfe2e3e252b6021e","html_url":"https://github.com/flowercomputers/bogkit/commit/8a4ef607df37ecfab5c5d0bebfe2e3e252b6021e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/commits/8a4ef607df37ecfab5c5d0bebfe2e3e252b6021e/comments","author":{"login":"rcrdlbl","id":40729534,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzI5NTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40729534?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl","html_url":"https://github.com/rcrdlbl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"rcrdlbl","id":40729534,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzI5NTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40729534?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl","html_url":"https://github.com/rcrdlbl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"f8b6a78d0a75bc902f9bb4ecc5c25470fffea315","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/commits/f8b6a78d0a75bc902f9bb4ecc5c25470fffea315","html_url":"https://github.com/flowercomputers/bogkit/commit/f8b6a78d0a75bc902f9bb4ecc5c25470fffea315"}]},{"sha":"cf66313a521fcd26e62fc58bbc0a7930e5a5f180","node_id":"C_kwDOTWXhVNoAKGNmNjYzMTNhNTIxZmNkMjZlNjJmYzU4YmJjMGE3OTMwZTVhNWYxODA","commit":{"author":{"name":"rcrdlbl","email":"bluh@outlook.com","date":"2026-07-12T19:40:49Z"},"committer":{"name":"rcrdlbl","email":"bluh@outlook.com","date":"2026-07-12T19:40:49Z"},"message":"mmo-cs: persist/resume battle state, fix simultaneous elimination, extract win-condition tests\n\n- battle::run now resumes the most recent unfinished battle on startup\n  (status/timers/park persisted to battle.json alongside the fold stores)\n  instead of always starting fresh at id 1 — which could also delete a\n  previous completed battle's directory on id reuse. A fresh battle now\n  always picks an id past the highest one already on disk, so it never has\n  cause to touch existing data. The elimination debounce doesn't survive a\n  restart (documented why that's an acceptable, non-correctness-affecting\n  gap), and a stable MMO_DATA_DIR is required for resume to have anything\n  to resume from.\n- Extracted win-condition decision logic into a new win module: pure\n  functions (TeamSnapshot, check_elimination, check_timeout) with no fold\n  dependency, unit-testable on their own. check_elimination now evaluates\n  both teams before deciding anything, so a team confirmed swept in the\n  exact same tick as its opponent resolves to an explicit tie instead of\n  whichever team happened to be checked first.\n- web.rs: normalized the axum import block to what cargo fmt expects.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"93b566d53ccc845053e28ccf4ac5b4039462e718","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/git/trees/93b566d53ccc845053e28ccf4ac5b4039462e718"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/git/commits/cf66313a521fcd26e62fc58bbc0a7930e5a5f180","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAge67vLMJpFKoylT1GXAp6jFhklz\nSETagmDKa9bm63+OoAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQOpv0ff9p3Qp784sq0mBsLn787pFOnVRMge8is//diq+FHmfp2lGWzLV2CbAqW3g8D\ns22NI/vn5cRu0NQaUUaw8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 93b566d53ccc845053e28ccf4ac5b4039462e718\nparent 8a4ef607df37ecfab5c5d0bebfe2e3e252b6021e\nauthor rcrdlbl <bluh@outlook.com> 1783885249 -0400\ncommitter rcrdlbl <bluh@outlook.com> 1783885249 -0400\n\nmmo-cs: persist/resume battle state, fix simultaneous elimination, extract win-condition tests\n\n- battle::run now resumes the most recent unfinished battle on startup\n  (status/timers/park persisted to battle.json alongside the fold stores)\n  instead of always starting fresh at id 1 — which could also delete a\n  previous completed battle's directory on id reuse. A fresh battle now\n  always picks an id past the highest one already on disk, so it never has\n  cause to touch existing data. The elimination debounce doesn't survive a\n  restart (documented why that's an acceptable, non-correctness-affecting\n  gap), and a stable MMO_DATA_DIR is required for resume to have anything\n  to resume from.\n- Extracted win-condition decision logic into a new win module: pure\n  functions (TeamSnapshot, check_elimination, check_timeout) with no fold\n  dependency, unit-testable on their own. check_elimination now evaluates\n  both teams before deciding anything, so a team confirmed swept in the\n  exact same tick as its opponent resolves to an explicit tie instead of\n  whichever team happened to be checked first.\n- web.rs: normalized the axum import block to what cargo fmt expects.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","verified_at":"2026-07-12T19:40:56Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/commits/cf66313a521fcd26e62fc58bbc0a7930e5a5f180","html_url":"https://github.com/flowercomputers/bogkit/commit/cf66313a521fcd26e62fc58bbc0a7930e5a5f180","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/commits/cf66313a521fcd26e62fc58bbc0a7930e5a5f180/comments","author":{"login":"rcrdlbl","id":40729534,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzI5NTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40729534?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl","html_url":"https://github.com/rcrdlbl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"rcrdlbl","id":40729534,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzI5NTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40729534?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl","html_url":"https://github.com/rcrdlbl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"8a4ef607df37ecfab5c5d0bebfe2e3e252b6021e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/commits/8a4ef607df37ecfab5c5d0bebfe2e3e252b6021e","html_url":"https://github.com/flowercomputers/bogkit/commit/8a4ef607df37ecfab5c5d0bebfe2e3e252b6021e"}]},{"sha":"a7713783e4bde613c91fce1ecce851a5a374af2d","node_id":"C_kwDOTWXhVNoAKGE3NzEzNzgzZTRiZGU2MTNjOTFmY2UxZWNjZTg1MWE1YTM3NGFmMmQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"rcrdlbl","email":"bluh@outlook.com","date":"2026-07-12T19:46:36Z"},"committer":{"name":"rcrdlbl","email":"bluh@outlook.com","date":"2026-07-12T19:46:36Z"},"message":"mmo-cs: reset stale team choice when the server starts a new battle\n\nThe server auto-starts a fresh battle the instant one ends, but a\nreturning client's localStorage-persisted team choice survived across\nbattles — leaving the join buttons hidden and \"start battle\" stuck\ndisabled forever with no way back into the flow. Track the battle id\nclient-side and clear the stale choice when it changes, so joining and\nstarting works the same for every match, not just the first.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ee98903a734f99e053862d8682288c1bb7d2c10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/git/trees/6ee98903a734f99e053862d8682288c1bb7d2c10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/git/commits/a7713783e4bde613c91fce1ecce851a5a374af2d","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAge67vLMJpFKoylT1GXAp6jFhklz\nSETagmDKa9bm63+OoAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGwk/2FBJElL+6Gq652dBbnZvS5G3MT7HivNoGDa6VEycKgaX5h19jBE+x3CrHPucY\nfLSlorORpFYPVpX9nxDgQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 6ee98903a734f99e053862d8682288c1bb7d2c10\nparent cf66313a521fcd26e62fc58bbc0a7930e5a5f180\nauthor rcrdlbl <bluh@outlook.com> 1783885596 -0400\ncommitter rcrdlbl <bluh@outlook.com> 1783885596 -0400\n\nmmo-cs: reset stale team choice when the server starts a new battle\n\nThe server auto-starts a fresh battle the instant one ends, but a\nreturning client's localStorage-persisted team choice survived across\nbattles — leaving the join buttons hidden and \"start battle\" stuck\ndisabled forever with no way back into the flow. Track the battle id\nclient-side and clear the stale choice when it changes, so joining and\nstarting works the same for every match, not just the first.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","verified_at":"2026-07-12T19:47:09Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/commits/a7713783e4bde613c91fce1ecce851a5a374af2d","html_url":"https://github.com/flowercomputers/bogkit/commit/a7713783e4bde613c91fce1ecce851a5a374af2d","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/commits/a7713783e4bde613c91fce1ecce851a5a374af2d/comments","author":{"login":"rcrdlbl","id":4072953